## Issues I ran into

It's kinda funny that if you search up an issue you're having, someone already had the issue before you and you can just look at the solution they were given

### 💥 Resizable divider resizing self
When any line of the preview exceeded the width of the preview, it would resize the preview till the point it fits properly, until eventually collapsing the divider entirely, I fixed this by applying min-width: 0 which prevents it from resizing

### ↕️ Linecount not scrolling
When scrolling, the linecount didn't follow, so I set the linecount to scroll with the textarea element using a JS property called "scrollTop"

### 😵 Textarea cursor fighting divider cursor
When dragging the divider, it wouldn't stay as the grabbing icon since it would hover over the textarea element, so I had to go and fix it so that they wouldn't override each other

